{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51184","headline":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 三 · 王梵志","name":"兀然无事（原卷缺题，不分篇段，现将分爲十一首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我不乐生天，亦不爱福田。\n饥来一鉢饭，困来展脚眠。\n愚人以爲笑，智者谓之然。\n非愚亦非智，不是玄中玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}